rds by saying it","x":0.15398462729738599},{"y":0.42362885782924109,"h":0.021696473901922086,"t":"louder, or by his intonation or pitch. In Waray-Waray words in a sentences are given relative","w":0.75963156307444846,"x":0.15400630580904154},{"x":0.15413532077845141,"y":0.40843023244514065,"w":0.75751881318933822,"h":0.017478858774358508,"t":"importance by \"marking\" them with a I Class word. Sometimes these I Class words are the"},{"t":"himoing onon pich.","y":0.39999999989076551,"x":0.26344086292394908,"h":0.045909090909090899,"w":0.19354838651769302},{"x":0.15601505576867253,"w":0.75563907398897046,"h":0.014704017205671827,"y":0.3922727269663816,"t":"subiect of the sentence; at other times they are the object of the action, or the recipient or"},{"x":0.15413533794943041,"w":0.19172932344324445,"h":0.017727272727272703,"y":0.37045454521636001,"t":"beneficiary of the action."},{"t":"The latter will be learned in a later lesson.","y":0.3750000000183944,"w":0.32330824908088246,"h":0.015988372455943756,"x":0.35526317132422042},{"t":"Examples","x":0.1560150377325473,"h":0.020348836725408437,"w":0.095864661721622252,"y":0.32848837250454377},{"w":0.016917292651008164,"t":"1.","x":0.21428571441227789,"h":0.014534883499145557,"y":0.3008720933158342},{"t":"2.","x":0.21428571427387694,"y":0.28343023260443234,"w":0.015037593841552732,"h":0.014534883499145557},{"h":0.015988372455943756,"t":"3.","x":0.21240601504183756,"y":0.26453488373932466,"w":0.020676691391888796},{"x":0.21240601479900889,"t":"4.","w":0.018796992582433364,"y":0.24563953465865607,"h":0.015988372455943645},{"t":"Pilipino ka.","w":0.092572874181410858,"y":0.3001039967832011,"h":0.018978053006258877,"x":0.27232258612458787},{"x":0.57894737353151093,"t":"You are a Filipino.","h":0.016041226820512233,"y":0.30227272686385498,"w":0.1466165340647978},{"t":"Amerikano ako.","w":0.1299541608025046,"x":0.27430863409382433,"y":0.28293423912769211,"h":0.021340824473987996},{"t":"I am an American.","w":0.1466165340647978,